              <t:note>The following incipit is taken from<t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/PUNSH5BP"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Budge1928History"/><title level="m">A History of Ethiopia, Nubia &amp; Abyssinia: &lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;(&lt;/hi&gt;According to the Hieroglyphic Inscriptions of Egypt and Nubia, and the Ethiopian Chronicles&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;)&lt;/hi&gt;</title><author><forename>Ernest Alfred Wallis</forename><surname>Budge</surname></author><pubPlace>London</pubPlace><publisher>Methuen &amp; Co.</publisher><date>1928</date><note type="url">https://cristoraul.org/english/readinghall/THIRDMILLENNIUMLIBRARY/Biographies/HAILE-SELASSIE/History-Of-Ethiopia-Nubia-And-Abyssinia.pdf</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">History</note><note type="tag">Language survey</note><note type="tag">bm:Budge1928History</note></note><note type="tag">History</note><note type="tag">Language survey</note><note type="tag">bm:Budge1928History</note><t:citedRange unit="page">595–596</t:citedRange></t:bibl></t:note>
             <t:div type="textpart" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="div2div1LIT5690MagicPrayer">
                <t:ab>
                    በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ አምላክ። ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ ሕማመ፡ ዓይነት፡ ወእንዘ፡ ይሐውር፡ እግዚእ፡ ኢየሱሱ፡ ውስተ፡ ባሕረ፡ <t:placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC7368Tiberias">ጥብርያደስ፡</t:placeName> ውእቱ፡ ወምስሌሁ፡
              ፲ወ፪ አርዳኢሁ፡ ወርዩ፡ መልክአ፡ ብእሲት፡ አረጊት፡ እንዘ፡ ትነብር፡ ውስተ፡ መንበር፡ ሕሡም፡ መፍርህት፡ ወመደንግዕት፡ ጥቀ፡ እስመ፡ ኮና፡ አዕይንቲሃ፡ ይበርቃ፡ ከመ፡ ወርቅ፡
              <t:supplied reason="undefined">ቀ</t:supplied>ይሕ፡ አእዳዊሃኒ፡ ወአእጋሪሃኒ፡ ከመ፡ ሥረገላት፡ ወእምአፉሃኒ፡ ይወጽእ፡ ነበልባለ፡ እሳት፡ መጠነ፡ ፷ወ፰ በአመት፡ ቆሙ፡
              ወይቤልዎ፡ አርዳኢሁ፡ ምንትኑ፡ ዝነገር፡ እግዚአ፡ ወይቤሎሙ፡ እግዚእነ፡ ዛቲስ፡ ዓይነ፡ ምድር፡ አኪት፡ ወርግምት፡ ይእቲ፡ ከመ፡ ሶበ፡ በአየት፡ ሐመረ፡ እንዘ፡ ተሐውር፡ ዲበ፡
              ባሕር፡ ትነጶላ፡ ፍጡነ፡ ወሶበ፡ ፈጠነ፡ ፈረሰ፡ ታወድቅ፡ ምስለ፡ ብእሲ፡ ዘይጼአኖ፡ ወሶበ፡ ርእየት፡ ላህመ፡ እንዘ፡ ትትሀለብ፡ ይነጽፍ፡ ሐሊባ፡ ወይከውን፡ ደመ፡ ወሶበ፡ ርእየት፡
              ብእሲተ፡ ምስለ፡ ወልዳ፡ ትፈለጦሙ፡ ወተሐጕሎሙ፡ ወለዛቲሰ፡ ዓይነ፡ ምድር፡ እኪት፡ ወርግመት፡ ይእቲ፡ ንሥኡ፡ አውእይዋ፡ በእሳት፡ ለሥጋሃ፡ ወዝርውዋ፡ በነፋስ፡
              ምሥራቀ፡ ወምዕራበ፡ ሰሜነ፡ ወደቡበ፡ ከመ፡ ይጥፋዕ፡ እምድር፡ ዝክራ፡ ከማሁ፡ ይጥፋዕ፡ ሕማሞ፡ ዓይነት፡ እምላዕለ፡ ሀፍሳ፡ ወሥጋሃ፡ ለዓመትከ፡ ወለተ፡ ሐይወት።
                </t:ab>
             </t:div>
             </t:div>
            <t:div type="edition" xml:id="div3LIT5690MagicPrayer">
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:note>The following incipit is taken from <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/IVEf91#ms_i1">Saint Petersburg, Institut Vostočnyh Rukopisej Rossijskoj Akademii Nauk, IV Ef. 91: Ṣalot baʾǝnta ḥǝmāma ʿaynat (in ms_i1)</t:ref>.</t:note>
                    <t:ab>ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ ዓይነ፡ ጥላ፡ ወዓይነ፡ ወርቅ፡ ጸሎተ፡ ንድራ፡ ዝውእቱ፡ ሕማመ፡ ዓይነ፡ እኩይ፡</t:ab>
                </t:div>
            </t:div>
            <t:div type="edition" xml:id="div4LIT5690MagicPrayer">
                <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <t:note>The following incipit is taken from <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ANLcr32#ms_i9">Rome, Biblioteca dell’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei, Conti Rossini 32: Ṣalot baʾǝnta ḥǝmāma ʿaynat (in ms_i9)</t:ref>.</t:note>
                    <t:ab>በስመ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/>ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ አይነተ፡ ባርያ፡ ወአይነ፡ ወርቅ፡ ሕማመ፡ ነደራ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወእንዘ፡ የሐውር፡ እግዚእነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ አርዳኢሁ፡ ምስሌሁ፡ ወርእዩ፡ መልክዓ፡ ገጻ፡ ለአሮጊት እንዘ፡ ትገብር፡ላቲ፡ መፍርህት፡ ወመደንግፅት፡</t:ab>
                </t:div>
            </t:div>
        </t:body>
    </t:text></TEI>